Backend:
  Runtime: Node.js 20+
  Framework: Express.js 4.18+
  Language: TypeScript 5.3+
  
Database:
  Primary: MongoDB 7.0 (user data, domains, agents)
  Cache: Redis 7.2 (sessions, rate limiting, AI response cache)
  Search: Elasticsearch 8.x (logs, full-text search)
  Analytics: PostgreSQL + TimescaleDB (metrics, billing)
  
Infrastructure:
  Container: Docker + Kubernetes
  CI/CD: GitHub Actions + ArgoCD
  Monitoring: Prometheus + Grafana + OpenTelemetry
  Logging: Winston + Elasticsearch + Kibana
  
Security:
  Auth: JWT (HS512) + Passport (OAuth2)
  Encryption: AES-256-GCM (at rest), TLS 1.3 (in transit)
  Secrets: HashiCorp Vault
  WAF: Cloudflare / AWS WAF
